{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"990987385f9345c89eb83dc39e7d537ee7998196781a5bd09368af866959d04c","ja":"亜利沙の悩み","zh":"亚利沙的烦恼","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"9cdbd60bcf3ad83c50c2677de0f2b1a39bfaad0f4f25df86f2022220c77ce3e9","ja":"はぁ…………。","zh":"唉…………","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7505a5965e84e081aa66bfff5699fb7693f4b7ce82402f4597b6bdabee9d8735","ja":"あっ、真くん、伊織ちゃん！\nあの、少し相談に乗ってもらえませんか！？","zh":"啊，真、伊织！\n那个，能找你们商量点事吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"16447073fef4c010224496eb4ba514e04ee7efaf72bb0c3b377fc884b90c0ab1","ja":"相談？　いいわよ、なにかしら？","zh":"商量事情？可以呀，怎么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f0591e0e5c3ffc48852806bddecc5e6ba9a9c8f77abf015448616996243b80d8","ja":"実は最近、共演するアイドルちゃんから\nよく声をかけてもらえるんですけど……。","zh":"其实最近，经常有同台演出的偶像小姑娘\n来主动找我搭话……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"55e0d3eb51770fa29bc1fb18ae54f58d641ff73bdbdb48166063799fed445e31","ja":"へぇ～、良かったじゃない！","zh":"诶～，这不是挺好的嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2e9e7dfad89b0836e1b6492d22a9e69605b7daa64f47252b5bb3f057c506928d","ja":"そうなんです！　アイドルちゃんから\n話しかけてくれるなんて、もう夢のようで！","zh":"就是说啊！偶像居然主动跟我搭话，\n简直就像在做梦一样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7eff6eb65d5c52b9b69cb0d76aa6945aef086aa835fb5a96bab09860cd862b3d","ja":"……でも、そのときによく、「シトリム王子を\nやってほしい」ってお願いされてしまって……。","zh":"……不过，那时候经常被拜托说\n“希望能由你来演西特林王子”……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"065a3044feb19357408040f399bdae1291c75be79eca3fea120f0b519a520e4d","ja":"あ～、なるほど。ボクもイケメン役をやると\nカッコいいセリフをお願いされることあるな～。","zh":"啊～，原来如此。我演帅哥角色的时候，\n也经常会被人要求说帅气的台词呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8ecbdc6d60e451829b2477755873a8d8ac8752e9ce6ee98df8a2b9e8f2f3f9d7","ja":"カッコいい役でモテちゃうのも大変なのね。","zh":"因为演了帅气的角色而大受欢迎，也挺不容易的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"50db659b30385b62f53f11773723045675c22b1dda0a8896b5ce15e3e35fa36e","ja":"映画を観てもらえたのも\n声をかけてもらえるのもうれしいんですけど……。","zh":"电影能被大家看到，\n也有人跟我搭话，虽然这些都很开心……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"52b882cd9ef804081867812890aab59a63e469a1c201e2e882ee55fd85215ac8","ja":"でも撮影じゃないのに\nシトリム王子をするのはちょっと恥ずかしくて……。","zh":"不过又不是在拍摄，\n要演西特里姆王子还是有点难为情……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"2514ab0a2ae84e6185e0b058124b1c8295340e2ecb2b24926da57843995b4303","ja":"だから、王子様をお願いされなくなる方法があれば\n教えてほしいんです！","zh":"所以，要是有能不再被拜托演王子殿下的方法，\n还请您教教我！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"fd7ca58778396467e88c7d5fe2185b3cf81498b990fe9dc30c14afe5120fab81","ja":"うーん……。でも要は気の持ちようなんだし、\n真みたいに割り切ってやってあげたら？","zh":"唔……不过说到底还是要看心态，\n像真那样想得开一点，配合她一下不就好了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"33793b202115b41c07989560d46d218a14ca5d948450358b6c48646d3c21b48b","ja":"でも、急にやってって言われると\nやっぱり照れちゃうよね……。","zh":"但是，突然被叫去表演的话，\n果然还是会不好意思呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1365.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"41b0aaac4516dba28addcf00fcd780f222794c859b671ead5ef0e175067999e9","ja":"それなら任せて！\nボクにとっておきの方法があるから！","zh":"那就交给我吧！\n我有个绝妙的办法！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
